        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/rabit/{size}/7330_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-07-23T20:03:46.235Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For me, it’s:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>H</li>\n<li>SCRPG attack</li>\n<li>SCRPG boost</li>\n<li>SCRPG defend</li>\n<li>SCRPG hinder</li>\n<li>SCRPG overcome</li>\n<li>SCRPG recover</li>\n<li>SCRPG d4</li>\n<li>SCRPG d6</li>\n<li>SCRPG d8</li>\n<li>SCRPG d10</li>\n<li>SCRPG d12</li>\n<li>SI Badlands</li>\n<li>SI Beast</li>\n<li>SI Blight</li>\n<li>SI Dahan</li>\n<li>SI Disease</li>\n<li>SI (Each of the elements)</li>\n<li>SI Fear</li>\n<li>SI Explorer</li>\n<li>SI Town</li>\n<li>SI City</li>\n<li>SI Presence</li>\n<li>SI Sacred site</li>\n<li>SI Strife</li>\n<li>SI Wilds</li>\n<li>SI Isolate</li>\n<li>SI Defend</li>\n<li>SI (Any new stuff that might be coming? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/wink.png?v=9\" title=\":wink:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":wink:\"> )</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Did I miss anything, folks? <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/unamused.png?v=9\" title=\":unamused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":unamused:\"></p>",
