        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-08-18T21:39:48.158Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yay!</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/12a32deb720b4dd647e7e614ad8e2792bc0edf86.png?v=10\" title=\":beast:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":beast:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/0d84df877d3b8126f6cdb24f2a433ca4ed09111e.png?v=10\" title=\":dahan:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":dahan:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a2363912be60a5cb57c2a99088aca3296a78b746.png?v=10\" title=\":defendsi:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":defendsi:\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7abe67099d9621b9331c20610436e33e91958505.png?v=10\" title=\":water:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":water:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/975d3283fa6d5a290637cb208757d13dac0df5c5.png?v=10\" title=\":sun:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":sun:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/15e40dc64f4f97c83b50ce286d8051af06fc7850.png?v=10\" title=\":plant:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":plant:\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b95424d0f72d9fac9ddf9c56299c75bf65f62abf.png?v=10\" title=\":h:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":h:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/6/694431ff2dcb8b161d7039f29ba03711e88fe4d2.png?v=10\" title=\":disease:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":disease:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/5/5f16f04ab104b85302186b400127e662227d4713.png?v=10\" title=\":wild:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":wild:\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/dcf579103cd83d8511edc1208e33ff4408dcb1f1.png?v=10\" title=\":presence:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":presence:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/95301a41a6e8954652e71babde0a1319bbb98ef0.png?v=10\" title=\":blight:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":blight:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/08bfea9469bb5f0601303ed4b1c4eef7ab7c38de.png?v=10\" title=\":fear:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":fear:\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/a/a3fb4193f74b05dbab4fb77292bc629ac67fbbd1.png?v=10\" title=\":isolate:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":isolate:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7772efd900c72eea34bd56dbee0bcfa3f044f571.png?v=10\" title=\":earth:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":earth:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/1/1b1cacb3068ce485251e60c212078870c838e7b0.png?v=10\" title=\":animal:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":animal:\"><br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/93428f4991eb22d41c60c07037d41956a110379a.png?v=10\" title=\":town:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":town:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c4b4d0cf9ec8071392860b7bb252e4590c807b11.png?v=10\" title=\":city:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":city:\"> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/0/01359f9c4bfc8e67bd4ddb8881ac697e0ec285c6.png?v=10\" title=\":fire:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom only-emoji\" alt=\":fire:\"></p>\n<p>And they look good in dark mode too.</p>\n<p>However, a minor bit of pedantry: the :invader: icon is called <code>:invader:</code>, yet the name of that piece in <em>Spirit Island</em> is “explorer.” You’ve already done a lot, though, and I’m not asking for more.</p>",
