        "cooked": "<p>Earth!<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/820d55c96e037ba7847b1e1e4c851331fdc04f0f.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"iyuDLSIwQcRy3dqaIRB6MXPwbtd\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"><br>\nFire!<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9bd1f6baf164d53011f63185f6aba3046bab1343.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"merQTWXgxvgxYGEv0f26Vut5qzV\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"><br>\nWind!<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/9/9effdf5c4f27d87a1a8a795e50349832dade763f.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mGzDXZtjtiHJoAP8G9OQCbCfKaj\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"><br>\nWater!<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/8/8df715ca9c7c4ff974ac9c2c6104f15a4aff0470.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"kfSHrKx0AcmZDRXPmePs1gNRnLa\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"><br>\nHeart!<br>\n<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/b/ba5edcdb88deb38df36532b0de95b506cc406285.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qAI3dI7K4wsd2sUgax6aoh3RVpH\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"><br>\nBy your presence combined, I am Slumbering Serpent!<img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/f65539bdb20ee379030610afc82a4a1de95e6f42.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"z9a3gjpB6wMVuRD9U65vgELVZrs\" width=\"250\" height=\"162\"></p>",
