        "created_at": "2022-03-23T17:47:57.774Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/slip-the-flow-of-time-clarification/29199\">a post</a>, I just tried to use the Spirit Island Moon Element Icon, but it didn’t work. Typing <code>:moon:</code> just gets the generic moon emoji: <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/moon.png?v=12\" title=\":moon:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":moon:\">. And when I look at the Custom Emoji section of the post-editing interface’s Emoji Menu, the SI Moon icon is nowhere to be found.</p>",
