        "created_at": "2023-01-30T01:47:18.806Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Testing a Spirit Island <code>:moon:</code> <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/f/fd0bf1f375c255ea039afbf8e307ad3f0e283a13.png?v=12\" title=\":moon:\" class=\"emoji emoji-custom\" alt=\":moon:\"></p>\n<p>Looks like existing <code>:moon:</code> emoji on prior posts will retain the old emoji. If you <em>really</em> want it changed, an admin can edit your post and fix it just by editing/saving the post.</p>",
